  "summary": "A modern painting technique using multiple layers of molten wax and pigments to build up texture and depth, often incorporating mixed media elements.",
  "description": "This approach creates works with rich tactile surfaces, visible brushstrokes, and translucent layers that reveal underlying colors, achieved through the careful application and fusing of wax layers. It developed as artists rediscovered ancient encaustic techniques and adapted them to contemporary artistic concerns.",
